#, python-format
msgid "Installing ASUS ZenBook Linux Tools %s."
msgstr "Pag-install ng ASUS ZenBook Linux Tools %s."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:169
msgid ""
"Installs the WMI hotkey daemon for ScreenPad brightness, fan Quiet/Balanced/"
"Performance, camera privacy, and window swap across monitors."
msgstr ""
"Nag-i-install ng WMI hotkey daemon para sa ScreenPad brightness, Quiet/"
"Balanced/Performance fan, privacy ng camera, at pagpapalitan ng window sa "
"mga monitor."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:173
msgid ""
"Installs the speaker amplifier fix and a suspend/resume hook so supported "
"ZenBook audio recovers after boot and after sleep."
msgstr ""
"Nag-i-install ng speaker amplifier fix at suspend/resume hook upang bumalik "
"ang suportadong ZenBook audio pagkatapos mag-boot at pagkatapos matulog."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:171
msgid ""
"Installs the touchpad Share gesture listener so a top-left corner tap opens "
"your desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, and peers)."
msgstr ""
"Nag-i-install ng touchpad Share gesture listener upang ang tap sa kaliwang "
"itaas na sulok ay magbukas ng desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, at "
"mga katulad)."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:197
